/* Notable — English.

   The keys are the German source strings: Notable was written in German, and
   the German text in the code IS the key. This file is what turns it into
   English. Generated once and then maintained by hand — a key that is missing
   here falls back to itself, which means the German shows through, so a gap is
   visible rather than silent.

   Entries that map to themselves are deliberate: numbers, separators and
   product names must not be translated. */

